  "description": "A half-fish person with shimmering scales and an irresistible voice.",
  "features": [
    {
      "name": "Captive Audience",
      "kind": "Passive",
      "rulesText": "If the Siren makes a standard attack against a target Entranced by their song, the attack deals 2d10+1 damage instead of their standard damage."
    },
    {
      "name": "Enchanting Song",
      "kind": "Action",
      "rulesText": "Spend a Fear to sing a song that affects all targets within Close range. Targets must succeed on an Instinct Reaction Roll or become Entranced until they mark 2 Stress. Other Sirens within Close range of the target can mark a Stress to each add a +1 bonus to the Difficulty of the reaction roll. While Entranced, a target can’t act and is Vulnerable."
    }
  ],
